    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_03",
      "hash64": "AA1A4EEB935F6D0A",
      "text": "厄鬼椪那件事，\\n真是太感謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳了。[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
