        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_11",
      "hash64": "AA1748EB935D2D01",
      "text": "……就算寶伴做了壞事，\\n但那些可愛的石像是無辜的。[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_12",
      "hash64": "AA1745EB935D27E8",
      "text": "事情就是這樣……\\n為了修復寶伴像，\\r\\n我要募集[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]寶伴愛心捐款[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
