      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_25",
      "hash64": "AA13BCEB935A0946",
      "text": "我馬上跟修理公司聯絡。\\n嘟、嘟、嘟……！[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_26",
      "hash64": "AA13BBEB935A0793",
      "text": "喂？是我是我。\\n上次說的那件事，錢我已經湊到了，\\r\\n請工人他們開工吧～！[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_27",
      "hash64": "AA13BAEB935A05E0",
      "text": "修復工程好像已經完畢了！\\n機會難得，我們一起去看看吧！[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_28",
      "hash64": "AA13C9EB935A1F5D",
      "text": "哦哦……這就是……！[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_29",
      "hash64": "AA13C8EB935A1DAA",
      "text": "用寶伴愛心捐款\\n浴火重生的寶伴像！！[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_30",
      "hash64": "AA103BEB9356F83C",
      "text": "這……難以言喻的既視感！\\n看起來就跟以前一模一樣！[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_worker_01",
      "hash64": "CC9B1C239B704542",
      "text": "我們把原本有的損傷和髒污\\n也都完美重現了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_31",
      "hash64": "AA103CEB9356F9EF",
      "text": "哈哈哈！各位師傅們的\\n技術還真是高超呢！[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_32",
      "hash64": "AA103DEB9356FBA2",
      "text": "只要有這寶伴像當照相景點，\\n觀光客就會來拍網美照，村子就要賺大錢啦！[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_37",
      "hash64": "AA103AEB9356F689",
      "text": "萬歲～！萬歲～！\\n來，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳也跟我一起來！[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
